  "title": "Best Pork Chop Marinade",
  "description": "This pork chop marinade made with mustard, garlic, Worcestershire sauce, brown sugar, and lemon juice makes tender, juicy, flavorsome pork chops!",
  "authors": [
    "BethAnne923"
  ],
